: Showcase your skills to stand out to employers. Career Readiness Credential This credential will help you communicate your experiences and make informed decisions as you navigate toward your career goals. LC State Credentials arrow-right--line Contact Information contact-card--solid Student Employment & Career Readiness Center Student Union Building/Center For Student Leadership 202 500 8th Avenue Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-2144 envelope--solid secc@lcsc.edu time--solid Mon-Fri, 8:00 - 5:00 instagram--solid Learn More. Do More. #LCState #TheWarriorWay Join us in helping students Do More. Give to LC State arrow-right--line Academic Calendar Map & Directions Emergency Information Provide Feedback Consumer Information Contact Information Offices & Services Directory facebook--solid instagram--solid youtube--solid twitter--solid pin--solid 500 8th Avenue, Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-5272 Accessibility Public Safety Discrimination & Harassment Privacy Policy Terms of Use © Lewis-Clark State College Chat with us , powered by LiveChat"
