u Employers eager to connect with LC State students Let Your Profile Work for You! exit--solid The career search is not a one-way street! When you complete your profile two things happen: Handshake will recommend jobs, internships, or events based on your career interests Employers can find you; students with a full profile are 5 times as likely to be messaged by employer A Complete Profile Includes: exit--solid Resume & Career Interests Graduation Date & 1 Experience 5 Skills & 1 Organization Book an Appointment Need Help? Schedule an appointment today! Book an appointment through Handshake arrow-right--line Contact Information contact-card--solid Student Employment & Career Readiness Center Student Union Building/Center For Student Leadership 202 500 8th Avenue Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-2144 envelope--solid secc@lcsc.edu time--solid Mon-Fri, 8:00 - 5:00 instagram--solid Learn More. Do More. #LCState #TheWarriorWay Join us in helping students Do More. Give to LC State arrow-right--line Academic Calendar Map & Directions Emergency Information Provide Feedback Consumer Information Contact Information Offices & Services Directory facebook--solid instagram--solid youtube--solid twitter--solid pin--solid 500 8th Avenue, Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-5272 Accessibility Public Safety Discrimination & Harassment Privacy Policy Terms of Use © Lewis-Clark State College Chat with us , powered by LiveChat"
