cates arrow-right--line Admissions Become a Warrior arrow-right--line Affordability Tuition, Aid, and Scholarships arrow-right--line Student Life Activities, Clubs, and Housing arrow-right--line Athletics Keep up with the Warriors arrow-right--line About Perseverance and Possibility arrow-right--line A-Z Directory Academic Calendar Bookstore Campus Calendar Catalog Coeur d'Alene Center Discrimination & Harassment Emergency Information Faculty & Staff Directory Library Offices & Services Directory Transcripts facebook--solid instagram--solid youtube--solid twitter--solid LC State invites you to Do More through an education experience that emphasizes hands-on learning, small class sizes, faculty excellence, student-faculty interaction, and success after graduation. Apply Now arrow-right--line Visit Campus arrow-right--line Request Info arrow-right--line Explore Degrees arrow-right--line School of Career & Technical Education Career & Technical Education National Signing Day Celebrate the future Watch 2026 LC State Signing Day Watch the recorded livestream from April 2026 arrow-right--line School of Career & Technical Education In this Section open-close-angle Signing Day Explore Our Technical & Industrial Programs Faculty Resources State of Idaho CTE Perkins V Staff Directory Hospitality Opportunity Request Dean's List Watch for the upcoming 2027 National Signing Day Registration Lewis-Clark State College, Library 500 8th Ave. Lewiston, ID 83501 Date, Time and Location 5 th Annual CTE Signing Day details to be posted upon availability. Check out our CTE programs url--solid School of Career & Technical Education Technical & Industrial Division What to expect Students will join their peers to commit to their future technical program pathway and sign a Letter of Commitment to attend LC State once they have completed their high school career. It is truly an exciting and emotional moment for everyone involved. Individual signing ceremonies at each participating school will be held on the same day and tied together by live simulcasts from NC3’s central media hub. This allows anyone who is unable to attend and those who are just curious to share in the moment with all of the students. Truly an inspiring moment for all! Watch the replay of LC State's 1st Annual Signing Day! Q&A Q: Do I need to apply to LC State before registering for Signing Day? exit--solid A: No, you do not need to apply before registering for Signing Day. Please note the March 1st deadline for LC scholarship opportunities. Q: Do I have any obligations to LC State if I attend Signing Day? exit--solid A: No, you are not obligated but we want you to take this seriously, and explore the opportunities available to you. Q: How do I register for Signing Day? exit--solid Register here! Q: Are you interested in hosting a live watch party at your school? exit--solid A: Email Julie Lorentz for further information, jglorentz@lcsc.edu Q: How do I apply to LC State? exit--solid A: Apply here Q: How much is housing? exit--solid A: Housing options Additional Resources Apply to LC State (it only takes 10-15 minutes) Apply by March 1st so you don't miss out on scholarship opportunities! Register for Signing Day Here! Contact Information contact-card--solid Career & Technical Education Mechanical Technical Building 500 8th Avenue Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-2225 print--solid 208-792-2816 (fax) envelope--solid ctedean@lcsc.edu time--solid Mon-Fri, 8:00 - 5:00 Learn More. Do More. #LCState #TheWarriorWay Join us in helping students Do More. Give to LC State arrow-right--line Academic Calendar Map & Directions Emergency Information Provide Feedback Consumer Information Contact Information Offices & Services Directory facebook--solid instagram--solid youtube--solid twitter--solid pin--solid 500 8th Avenue, Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-5272 Accessibility Public Safety Discrimination & Harassment Privacy Policy Terms of Use © Lewis-Clark State College Chat with us , powered by LiveChat"
