tificates arrow-right--line Admissions Become a Warrior arrow-right--line Affordability Tuition, Aid, and Scholarships arrow-right--line Student Life Activities, Clubs, and Housing arrow-right--line Athletics Keep up with the Warriors arrow-right--line About Perseverance and Possibility arrow-right--line A-Z Directory Academic Calendar Bookstore Campus Calendar Catalog Coeur d'Alene Center Discrimination & Harassment Emergency Information Faculty & Staff Directory Library Offices & Services Directory Transcripts facebook--solid instagram--solid youtube--solid twitter--solid LC State invites you to Do More through an education experience that emphasizes hands-on learning, small class sizes, faculty excellence, student-faculty interaction, and success after graduation. Apply Now arrow-right--line Visit Campus arrow-right--line Request Info arrow-right--line Explore Degrees arrow-right--line School of Career & Technical Education Perkins V - Idaho State CTE School of Career & Technical Education In this Section open-close-angle Signing Day Explore Our Technical & Industrial Programs Faculty Resources State of Idaho CTE Perkins V Staff Directory Hospitality Opportunity Request Dean's List \"The Strengthening Career and Technical Education for the 21st Century Act\" (generally referred to as Perkins V) provides an opportunity for Career and Technical Education to help drive Idaho towards our goal of 60% of Idahoans between the ages of 25 and 34 possessing a degree or certificate by 2025, improve the occupational outlook of our students, and provide the skilled workforce Idaho employers need.  The Act also supports the recommendations of Idaho’s 2017 Workforce Development Task Force, to build CTE secondary and postsecondary program capacity to meet workforce demand.\" Idaho State CTE Perkins V Perkins V State of Idaho CTE Stakeholder Information & Survey Stakeholder Survey Perkins V Timeline Perkins V Data Idaho Dept. of Labor: Hot Job Projections by State & Region Comprehensive Local Needs Assessment Contact Information contact-card--solid Career & Technical Education Mechanical Technical Building 500 8th Avenue Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-2225 print--solid 208-792-2816 (fax) envelope--solid ctedean@lcsc.edu time--solid Mon-Fri, 8:00 - 5:00 Learn More. Do More. #LCState #TheWarriorWay Join us in helping students Do More. Give to LC State arrow-right--line Academic Calendar Map & Directions Emergency Information Provide Feedback Consumer Information Contact Information Offices & Services Directory facebook--solid instagram--solid youtube--solid twitter--solid pin--solid 500 8th Avenue, Lewiston, Idaho 83501 calls--solid 208-792-5272 Accessibility Public Safety Discrimination & Harassment Privacy Policy Terms of Use © Lewis-Clark State College Chat with us , powered by LiveChat"
